silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_02_identity_and_composition_sections_03_unit_and_associativity_laws_yoneda_hom_leg_2_aboutness_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S03UnitAndAssociativityLawsYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the VetRecord77 -> Mittens aboutness leg; an information arrow, not an isomorphism" .
